--- !u!114 &343731381
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 343731380}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ebb7ab4130872264fb9f492be0b625f2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Freestyle.Game.InterviewDirector
  battle: {fileID: 945999724}
  playerSpot: {fileID: 1391635969}
  interviewerSpot: {fileID: 1728250280}
  interviewer: {fileID: 5786649682953725951, guid: 9fe2e46de58e2c46c8cefd57d5911b2d, type: 3}
  fadeShader: {fileID: 4800000, guid: 8b0d9ab9d4db25cafa96e49a6fd5ee20, type: 3}
  intro:
    id: intro
    text: Good evening, and welcome. Before you take the stage, I have a few questions
      for tonight's program. Please answer aloud, in your own words.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d79e5acbd56fffe97b922012a5fa00d5, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: b84a35694c05ef0dbb651f531f479d7b, type: 3}
  questions:
  - id: q_name
    text: 'To begin: what name do you perform under?'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5bedf9bc3c6d991cdbabc7fcbbfde298, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 14f1d46581dd4ec229f039691406615f, type: 3}
  - id: q_from
    text: Where are you from, and whom do you represent this evening?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9d329567d6cdce86eb2347d75f63f12f, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 8f82a3de5227a3dc0ae6cf6fa8fb81a4, type: 3}
  - id: q_day
    text: And what do you do professionally, outside of competition?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9974c0f0d1f8854ea982fb2c2e787608, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 7cac2caf31eefc496bac49082cd3473e, type: 3}
  - id: q_hero
    text: Which artist has influenced you the most?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e594ec5e83a3de795bd2e90f3ec10758, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 48487ed41e636e341a91fdf91fc3c749, type: 3}
  - id: q_weak
    text: 'Strictly between us: is there a subject you would prefer your opponents
      not raise?'
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5add9245a24746e6aa6c3f159a49de7f, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: d52d17cbed42153bb9fc4d99d1808f66, type: 3}
  - id: q_last
    text: Finally, do you have a statement for your competitors?
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e128423eb834fc00c8a79117a1b4eb19, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: aa133621425f1ace08e935dedc011c8e, type: 3}
  affirmations:
  - id: ok_1
    text: Thank you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3058bf3101d15ab50b27d574aaa4cb3a, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: ad89f03e0ec8174c49020ed14051dac8, type: 3}
  - id: ok_2
    text: Very good.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5e32a1e9169d70770801e3324b8c7817, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 34010ac6a5dce9f1ba2fcf3b4e71452f, type: 3}
  - id: ok_3
    text: Understood.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 527c67bb282cf9a8983c2a50342d2c8a, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: a68cdce3302d8477ab27524a2acc8abe, type: 3}
  - id: ok_4
    text: Noted.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 67bd62ad1ee4222fc9d4880ad76a0183, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 1976085a17a2f71dc9502d2cf878c3c7, type: 3}
  - id: ok_5
    text: Excellent.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7a29f46bd34dc932988a4e64826a3fd6, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 2673104d54e34b432a576b6d782082b6, type: 3}
  - id: ok_6
    text: I see.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd28a68494d1eb4f6bd11b1019a9ac59, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: b9bd3e7a66ecb126c848ed10970ace1f, type: 3}
  outro:
    id: outro
    text: That concludes our interview. Thank you for your time, and best of luck
      this evening.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 31a433814d8f5a1458155ce320473287, type: 3}
    cues: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 6969aa98fb68afd8b966f240d1a60f5c, type: 3}
  endSilence: 1.6
  maxAnswer: 25
  giveUp: 8
  thinkingWait: 4
  maxThinkingWaits: 2
  sampleRate: 16000
